---
id: KelolaHariLibur-HapusHariLibur
title: Kelola Hari Libur - Hapus Hari Libur
---
%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"background": "#dddddd", "primaryColor": "#ffffff", "primaryBorderColor": "#000000", "primaryTextColor": "#000000", "lineColor": "#000000", "textColor": "#000000", "actorBkg": "#ffffff", "actorBorder": "#000000", "actorTextColor": "#000000", "activationBkgColor": "#ffffff", "activationBorderColor": "#000000", "signalColor": "#000000", "signalTextColor": "#000000", "labelBoxBkgColor": "#ffffff", "labelBoxBorderColor": "#000000", "labelTextColor": "#000000", "sequenceNumberColor": "#000000", "noteBkgColor": "#ffffff", "noteBorderColor": "#000000", "noteTextColor": "#000000"}, "sequence": {"useMaxWidth": true, "wrap": true, "messageFontSize": 12, "noteFontSize": 12}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SA as Super Admin/HR
    participant UI as Web UI :boundary
    participant C as HolidayController :control
    participant H as Holiday Model :entity
    participant DB as Database :entity

    SA->>UI: Klik tombol Hapus pada hari libur tertentu
    UI->>UI: Tampilkan konfirmasi penghapusan
    SA->>UI: Klik tombol "Hapus" pada dialog konfirmasi
    UI->>C: DELETE /admin/holidays/{id}
    C->>+H: Delete holiday berdasarkan id
    note over H: Cek: apakah sudah ada referensi atau data log terkait?
    alt Tidak ada referensi
        H->>+DB: DELETE FROM holidays WHERE id = ?
        DB-->>-H: Holiday berhasil dihapus
        H-->>C: Confirmation deleted
        C-->>UI: Response sukses
        UI-->>SA: Notifikasi penghapusan berhasil
    else Ada referensi
        H-->>C: Error - cannot delete, has references
        C-->>UI: Response error - hari libur masih digunakan
        UI-->>SA: Tampilkan pesan error: "Tidak dapat menghapus hari libur yang sudah digunakan"
    end

